<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa gasoline, diesel prices to fall in March.</title>
<headline>S.Africa gasoline, diesel prices to fall in March.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Central Energy Fund said gasoline prices would fall by four cents per litre and diesel would fall by 19 cents with effect from March 5.</p>
<p>Illuminating paraffin would fall by 13 cents per litre.</p>
</text>
